# Live GitHub data for the open-source section (refreshed hourly).
# Create a fine-grained token at https://github.com/settings/personal-access-tokens
# with "Public repositories (read-only)" and no other permissions, then copy this
# file to .env.local (and add the same variable in your host, e.g. Vercel).
# Without it the site falls back to src/content/github.json.
GITHUB_TOKEN=
